<title>USA: Fountain Oil names Nyberg chairman.</title>
<headline>Fountain Oil names Nyberg chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fountain Oil Inc said on Wednesday that its president, Oistein Nyberg, will become chairman, while his current title and chief executive duties will be assumed by Nils Trulsvik.</p>
<p>Fountain also has designated its Oslo, Norway office as its main operational center, and will move some people there from Houston.</p>
<p>Trulsvik, 48, currently is Fountain's chief operating officer. The current chairman, Robert Halpin, will become vice chairman.</p>
</text>
